      "content": "Thanks. I'm a bit worried about the p-values though. The latest run came back at 0.06, which is technically just above the 0.05 cutoff for significance. I don't want the reviewers to get hung up on that and think the whole study is a wash. How should we frame that specific number in the draft so it doesn't kill our chances?",
